<title>USA: TriNet settles with MacFrugals on warehouse.</title>
<headline>TriNet settles with MacFrugals on warehouse.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>TriNet Corporate Realty Trust Inc said on Monday that it reached a settlement with MacFrugal's Bargains Close-outs Inc over a New Orleans warehouse which was destroyed by a fire in March.</p>
<p>TriNet said in a statement that it agreed to terms that would compensate TriNet for the destruction, waive the requirement to rebuild and result in the cancellation of MacFrugal's lease.</p>
</text>
